Subject: [PATCH 7/7] fix(i18n): remove duplicate closing brace from en.json

The edit operation left an extra '}' at the root level, causing
JSONDecodeError and silent fallback to raw translation keys.
---
 kiauh/core/i18n/locales/en.json | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kiauh/core/i18n/locales/en.json b/kiauh/core/i18n/locales/en.json
index 743c1fe..e5e9376 100644
--- a/kiauh/core/i18n/locales/en.json
+++ b/kiauh/core/i18n/locales/en.json
@@ -309,4 +309,3 @@
         "component.hostname_error": "Error during change hostname procedure: {error}"
     }
 }
-}
